# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your key, then restart `pnpm dev`.
# Get a free API key at https://pixabay.com/api/docs/ (login required).
# NOTE: Vite inlines `VITE_*` variables into the client bundle at build time —
# the key ships to end users (Pixabay's own client-side JS example does the
# same). Rate limit: 100 requests / 60 s per key. Never use a secret here.
VITE_PIXABAY_KEY=